<title>FRANCE: French housing starts fall in 3-mos to end March.</title>
<headline>French housing starts fall in 3-mos to end March.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French housing ministry gave the following unadjusted figures on housing starts in March</p>
<p>			     3-mos to end     12-mos to end</p>
<p>				 March 1997     March 1997</p>
<p>HOUSING APPROVED</p>
<p> (total nos)		  72,900	  300,800</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		 -7.7		-3.0</p>
<p> STARTED			68,000	  268,000</p>
<p> (percent)		     -7.7		-3.7</p>
<p>NON-HOUSE BUILDING</p>
<p>APPROVED</p>
<p> (sq metres)		 7.08 million	32.58 million</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -4.3	     -5.8</p>
<p> STARTED		     6.66 million	29.75 million</p>
<p> percent			 -13.9	     -5.6</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
